    "work_id": "anf-works/venantius-on-easter",
    "canonical_ref": "VenFort.Pasch.s3",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "Armed with rays traversing the liquid elements, in this brief night he stretches out the day in a circle. The brilliant firmament puts forth its clear countenance, and the bright stars show their joy.",
